ads mikkelson of doctor strange and  hannibal boyd holbrook of logan and the  predator  shawnette renee wilson of the black  panther thomas crutchman of avengers age  of ultron toby jones of captain america  and the hunger games and antonia  banderas of the mask of zorro  now i'll be honest this seems like an  incredible cast with names ranging from  star wars movies to mcu titles it'll be  great to see all of this amazing talent  on screen together  although it seems pretty unlikely mark  hamill also joked about wanting to be  the newest villain in indiana jones 5.  even though it likely won't happen just  the idea of this is exciting and i can't  wait to see if it comes true  according to several different sources  and rumors it's likely that the story  will take place in the late 60s or early  70s with at least one plot point  revolving around the 1969 moon landing  or the astronauts return  other scenes in the movie may include a  castle in england and an ss motorbike  according to pictures taken on set so it  seems that the film's specific plot will  likely be hard to pin down at least  until the first trailer is released now  this is the first time one of the  indiana jones films will be released  since disney's acquisition of lucasfilm  so it'll be interesting to see if there  are any significant changes to previous  cuts of the movies from the franchise or  anything different on screen from what  we can typically expect from an indiana  jones film although the movie is set for  a mid-2022 release date i wouldn't be  surprised if it sees further setbacks  due to the pandemic and other onset  issues  even so it might be a good idea to start  re-watching the first four installments  of the indie franchise just so you're  ready for the newest chapter  but don't worry i'll be sure to do a  video on everything you need to know  before indiana jones 5 is released so be  sure to subscribe so you don't miss that  video and all of our other great content  also if you 